    title: "Boomer\'s Adventure in ASMIK World",
    description: Some("Boomer digs holes in the floor to drop the monsters chasing him, then fills them in to bury what fell inside, clearing a path through each maze floor of Zoozoon\'s tower. Buried ground also gives up keys and items — a boomerang to throw, a compass, roller skates — and eight floors up the dark lord waits."),
